OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fat first with variable cloud and some
OL,7,Fclear spells, but showers still in the
OL,8,Fnortheast. Further cloud and outbreaks
OL,9,Fof rain spread northeast overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FIt will be cloudy through
OL,12,Fthe day with further outbreaks of
OL,13,Frain, particularly in the morning with
OL,14,Fsome drier spells developing later in
OL,15,Fthe day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
