OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FCloudy Thursday morning with showers
OL,7,For longer periods of rain, turning dry
OL,8,Flater. Mostly dry with bright spells
OL,9,FFriday, some showers east. Chilly.
OL,10,FCloudier with the chance of rain
OL,11,FSaturday.
